SOAPBOX: My first ever Parks-to-Radiosport (P2R) international contest from
SOAPBOX: a Parks-On-the-Air designator Carrizo Plain National Monument
SOAPBOX: US-4541 near California Valley, California. My goal? Log as many
SOAPBOX: zones and countries as possible within 5 hours of operation. Needless
SOAPBOX: to say, I totally enjoyed my search and pounce strategy, throughout
SOAPBOX: my visit inside the monument. Visitors were curious with one saying,
SOAPBOX: "I didn't know they used Morse code anymore." If anything, Morse code
SOAPBOX: is alive and well, thanks for a great contest. 73. CQ like you mean
SOAPBOX: it. Contest like you own it.
